OL,3,GNEWSAGuernsey Electricity investigating
OL,4,Afuel smell
OL,5,
OL,6,FA utility firm is investigating reports
OL,7,Fof fuel odour at its power station
OL,8,Fafter reports by nearby businesses.
OL,10,FGuernsey Electricity said efforts have
OL,11,Fbeen made to establish if the most
OL,12,Frecently delivered fuel oil batches
OL,13,Fwere the cause of the issue.
OL,15,FBusinesses contacted the BBC to report
OL,16,Fa smell around The Bridge in The Vale,
OL,17,Fwhere Guernsey Electricity is based.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
