OL,3,GNEWSAGuernsey Electricity investigating
OL,4,Afuel smell
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company said if the issue is linked
OL,7,Fto the recently delivered oil, the
OL,8,Fbatches will be prioritised for power
OL,9,Fgeneration and it would review any
OL,10,Fadditional mitigation to deal with the
OL,11,Fsmell.
